{
    "title": "Indian Bike Gangster Simulator",
    "description": "Step into the thrilling world of indian bike gangster simulator, where you become the ultimate bike gangster in a dynamic open-world environment. Experience high speed chases, daring stunts and intense missions as you navigate the bustling streets.\r\n\r\nExciting Missions: \r\nEngage yourself in a variety of missions, from high-stakes snatching to battling rival gangs and invading the police. \r\n\r\nWide Range of Vehicles:\r\nEnjoy an extensive collection of vehicles, from bikes to sports cars, tanks and helicopters. Get a unique experience of police chases, battles and challenging action in the open world.\r\n\r\nSmooth Controls and realistic physics:\r\nEnjoy highly optimised driving controls to enhance the action gameplay experience with realistic physics.\r\n\r\nIndian bike gangsters provide an adrenaline pumping action experience with endless opportunities. Whether you\u2019re performing stunts on towering ramps or outsmart rivals in ultimate chases, become a feared bike gangster in the city.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Step into the thrilling world of indian bike gangster simulator, where you become the ultimate bike gangster in a dynamic open-world environment. Experience high speed chases, daring stunts and intense missions as you navigate the bustling streets.<br><br>Exciting Missions: <br>Engage yourself in a variety of missions, from high-stakes snatching to battling rival gangs and invading the police. <br><br>Wide Range of Vehicles:<br>Enjoy an extensive collection of vehicles, from bikes to sports cars, tanks and helicopters. Get a unique experience of police chases, battles and challenging action in the open world.<br><br>Smooth Controls and realistic physics:<br>Enjoy highly optimised driving controls to enhance the action gameplay experience with realistic physics.<br><br>Indian bike gangsters provide an adrenaline pumping action experience with endless opportunities. Whether you\u2019re performing stunts on towering ramps or outsmart rivals in ultimate chases, become a feared bike gangster in the city.",
